/* algorithm ... LithoRoot std L4 (S3, 2026-11-16): the algorithms the engine
 * and game use (census of 2026-11-16: max/min/clamp, sort, find..., about
 * 40 names) plus their close relatives.
 *
 * sort is introsort (median-of-3 quicksort, heapsort past 2*log2(n) depth,
 * insertion sort under 16): O(n log n) worst case, not stable. stable_sort
 * is a merge sort with a nothrow buffer, falling back to an in-place
 * rotation merge if the buffer cannot be had. For equal keys sort's order
 * differs from MSVC's; that never reaches native hashes (plan 3.7). */
#ifndef LITHOROOT_ALGORITHM
#define LITHOROOT_ALGORITHM
